    "limitations": [
      "No histology or anatomical-domain labels supplied: precise cortical layers cannot be confirmed.",
      "Spatially autocorrelated spots violate independence assumptions of spot-wise Wilcoxon tests; adjusted p-values are exploratory, not spatially corrected.",
      "PC-space silhouette is negative, so expression distributions overlap despite high spatial coherence; graph segmentation may favor spatial continuity over expression separation.",
      "SCGB2A2/SCGB1D2/TFF1/MUC1 secretory signatures are atypical for DLPFC; ambient RNA, technical contamination, or specimen heterogeneity cannot be excluded.",
      "Visium spots mix cell types and variable RNA depth; marker associations are not cell-type-specific.",
      "Only one tissue section; no cross-sample validation or external-reference labels used.",
      "The selection criterion and graph parameters may alter domain boundaries; spot-level uncertainty near transitions is not calibrated."
